    "notes": {
        "8e7d866b-b313-4991-ae2c-2750c3ae9b16": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 160,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nRun Report needs a custom report enabled as a web service in the test tenant:\n\n1. Create an **Advanced** custom report (e.g. on *All Workers*) named `E2E_Workers` and tick **Enable As Web Service**.\n2. Share it with the integration system user whose refresh token the test account uses.\n3. Set **Report Owner** and **Report Name** in the Run Report component to the owner username and report name from the report's web service URL (`/ccx/service/customreport2/<tenant>/<owner>/<report>`).\n\nWithout this report the flow fails with 404 or 403."
        }
    }
